Task: Per-user tour-state meta (PHP)

Summary: New BVM\Tours registers user meta 'bvm_tours_completed' (object map
tourId => true) with show_in_rest (additionalProperties boolean schema), a
sanitize callback (slug-safe keys only, truthy-only entries, MAX_TOURS=16
cap), and an auth callback restricting writes to the user's own meta. Wired
into Plugin::init and the plugin loader. No custom REST route: the JS runtime
writes through core /wp/v2/users/me.

